    "head_commit_message": "refactor(sim): the turn and the joins' order in the crate (spec 39 step 8a2-i)\n\nThe turn (turn.rs: ScrumTurn.begin and SquadTurn.reverse_ranks): a squad\nabout to move against the way it faces turns about, its places reversed,\nits front moved back by its depth and placed on its route, then faces its\nroute where it stands; unless its heading is unchanged its units in their\nframe are loosened where they stand. The joins' order (contact.rs,\nField::joins): waves that reached a friend's back rank join nearest first,\nthen by their draws. ScrumTurn keeps the swaps cancelled and the events,\nFormationJoins the lists and the events. SquadTurn.reverse_ranks retires;\nits scenarios are cargo tests.\n\nRecords 8a2's split (8a2-i, 8a2-ii, 8a2-iii) in spec 39.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi1qKEHavAaNPJ8uz2w",
